  "notes": [
    "The table defines one deterministic target paradigm per register tier.",
    "Possessives agree with the possessed noun, not with the addressee.",
    "Formal, Full Formal, Formal-Warm, and Reverse Formal share the आप paradigm; later verb, imperative, and honorific rules distinguish those tiers.",
    "तू is an intimate default for Full Informal and can sound rude outside genuinely close relationships; scenario selection must therefore happen before transformation.",
    "Postpositional forms cover से (instrumental/ablative/comitative), में (interior locative), पर/पे (surface locative), and तक (terminative).",
    "Multiword comitative, benefactive, proximity, and topic forms such as आपके साथ, आपके लिए, आपके पास, and आपके बारे में are already generated through masculine_plural_or_oblique plus an unchanged postposition."
